## Changed
* HTRF4 for the old fusion reactor has been removed
* Titanium bedrock ore on all planets changed to ilmenite, except for Tekto, which still provides pure titanium!
## Added
* Depletable rich iron and copper ores: metadata tracks richness, final unit turns the block to stone, no silk harvest
* Rich ore chunks (smelt/shred/centrifuge exactly like regular ores: x1/x2/x3)
* Per-variant ore richness config (default 250 units), exact counts kept in world save
* Rich ores rename as they deplete (Rich / Half-Depleted / Almost Depleted) in inventory and on the crosshair overlay
* Large Mining Drill mines rich blobs: one chunk per 3s alone, or the whole blob at 3.1s per block with vein miner on, scaled by drillbit speed
## Fixed
* Fixed the pollution detector's localization being broken
* Fixed an exploit achievable via packet manipulation
* Fixed assembly factory and chemical factory RoR reader index offset

## Fixed
* Solar panel ports inconsistent and don't match model